        <a href="/products" class="hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">Products</a>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
        <span class="text-charcoal-900 font-semibold">Oil Press Comparison</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-charcoal-900 mb-4">Hydraulic Oil Press Model Comparison</h1>
        <p class="text-steel-500 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">Compare all Haonuo hydraulic oil press models side by side. Find the right machine for your oil seed type, production scale, and budget.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ===== Hero Guide Card (合并 Quick Guide + Core Truth，统一视觉) ===== -->
      <div class="mb-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-white to-blue-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-amber-600 font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-2xl">💡</span> Before You Compare — 1 Core Truth + 3 Fast Rules
          </h2>
          <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed">
            From <b class="text-steel-800">HN300</b> to <b class="text-steel-800">HN500</b>, every standard Haonuo hydraulic press does the same thing: extract oil from seeds.<br><br>
            The difference between models is <b class="text-amber-600">only 3 things</b>:<br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;① <b>How many kg per batch</b> (barrel size)<br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;② <b>How much pressing force</b> (real tonnage — determines how hard a seed you can press and how cleanly)<br>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;③ <b>How big / heavy / expensive the machine is</b> (footprint, transportation, budget)<br><br>
            <span class="text-base text-steel-700">Choosing the right model depends on just 3 inputs: <b>your seed type, your target daily volume, your budget.</b></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 p-5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-blue-200">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2">⚠️ Model number ≠ Real tonnage</h3>
            <div class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Our model numbers are <b>series codes</b> shared across the industry, <b>not actual tonnage</b>.<br>
              For example: <b>HN426 = 500 real tons</b>, <b>HN480 = 600 real tons</b>, <b>HN500 = 630 real tons</b>.<br>
              Don't be misled by the number itself. The <b>real pressing tonnage</b> and <b>barrel diameter</b> are what matter. All tables below list <b>real parameters</b>.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-amber-100">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-steel-100 shadow-sm">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-charcoal-900 text-sm mb-1">By Oil Seed Type</h3>
              <p class="text-steel-600 text-sm">Soft seeds (sesame, peanut) → HN325/355. Hard seeds (walnut, almond) → HN426/480/500.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-steel-100 shadow-sm">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-charcoal-900 text-sm mb-1">By Production Scale</h3>
              <p class="text-steel-600 text-sm">Startup/small → HN300/325 single barrel. Commercial → HN355/400 double barrel. Industrial → HN500 double barrel.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-steel-100 shadow-sm">
            <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-charcoal-900 text-sm mb-1">By Oil Quality</h3>
              <p class="text-steel-600 text-sm">Standard quality → Standard models. Premium cold-pressed → HN426/480 with higher cake pressure.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 1: 🎯 Quick Model Selection (Tab 快速选型) -->
      <section class="mb-16 pt-2">
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between flex-wrap gap-3 mb-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-charcoal-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 text-xl">🎯</span>
              Quick Model Selection
            </h2>
            <p class="text-steel-500">Two ways to narrow it down. Unsure? Start with <b>Pick by Seed</b>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

