          <button type="button" data-sel-tab="seed" class="sel-tab-btn active px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-white text-amber-600 shadow">
            📊 Pick by Seed
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-sel-tab="scenario" class="sel-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-steel-600 hover:text-amber-600">
            🎴 Pick by Scenario
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab A: Pick by Seed table -->
        <div id="sel-tab-seed" class="sel-tab-panel">
          <!-- Truth note first -->
          <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-700 mb-2 text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>⚠️</span> Quick truth about per-batch capacity</h3>
            <div class="text-steel-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <b>All single-barrel models sharing the same barrel diameter load the same weight per batch,</b> regardless of model tonnage.<br>
              Standard 390 mm barrel: <b>≤ 100 kg / batch</b> for every model from HN300 through HN500.<br>
              Small 300 mm barrel: <b>≤ 60 kg / batch</b>.<br>
              Larger model numbers add <b>more pressing force</b> for harder seeds and cleaner extraction — not more per-batch capacity. To increase daily output, use <b>double-barrel</b> (one barrel presses while the other is loaded/unloaded) or extended operating hours.
