                <tr class="border-b border-steel-100">
                  <td class="px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="font-bold text-steel-900">Peanut, Rapeseed, Soybean, Sunflower, Tea Seed, Flax (common seeds)</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-steel-500">Soft–medium hardness. Peanut → HN325 first choice.</div>
                  </td>
